  "description": "Turn your ASP.NET Core endpoints into token-efficient Model Context Protocol (MCP) tools at build time. A Roslyn source generator plus runtime built on the official MCP SDK: add this one package and the [McpTool] attributes, the generator, and the MCP server SDK all come with it. Works with minimal APIs and controllers, with zero runtime reflection for tool discovery.",
